@startuml C1_OEM_Service_Process_View
title C1 – OEM Independent Service (Process View)

actor "Frontoffice SPA" as SPA
participant "TodoApi Gateway" as Gateway
participant "OEM REST API" as OEM
participant "Identity Provider" as IAM
participant "OEM Database" as Db

SPA -> Gateway : HTTPS request (/oem/...)
Gateway -> IAM : Validate JWT / scopes
IAM --> Gateway : Token OK
Gateway -> OEM : Forward REST call
OEM -> IAM : Introspect token (ABAC claims)
IAM --> OEM : Claims / roles
OEM -> Db : Execute business operation (CRUD)
Db --> OEM : Result rows
OEM --> Gateway : JSON response
Gateway --> SPA : JSON response

@enduml
